{"candidateAnswer":"The powerful impression the veterans made on him","evidence":"[D24:3 | 3:34 pm on 17 July, 2023] John: I heard some cool stories from an elderly veteran named Samuel. It was inspiring and heartbreaking, but seeing their resilience really filled me with hope. It reminded me why I wanted to join the military.","itemId":"urn:uuid:4c0f9f63-91a6-5cb7-8d04-95e1db2ffc74","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:776dfdb1771669506b9891da182adb35affd1cbbcf45f4b5baa27947d0b166d9","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Why did John feel inspired to join the military after the visit to the hospital?","referenceAnswer":"seeing the resilience of the veterans","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"776dfdb1771669506b9891da182adb35affd1cbbcf45f4b5baa27947d0b166d9"}}]}